v {xschem version=3.4.6 file_version=1.2
* driver_ffe (issue #21; generated by design/tx/gen_schematics.py)
*
* HBT CML line driver with 2-tap FFE (R5). Main pair Nx=8 / 10 mA tail;
* three Nx=1 post-cursor pairs of 1.11 mA each (0..3 slices => 0..6 dB
* de-emphasis in 4 steps) steer with crossed collectors from the
* one-UI-delayed stream (pip/pin). 50 ohm on-die back-termination to vdd.
* HBT and resistors only.
*
* First-cut sizing for the PROPOSED draft spec rows; not a spec result and
* not a measurement. Traces to sim/pdk.json.
}
